    runai: target Gemma-4-E4B-It with 4-bit quantization for ~10GB Blackwell GPU
    
    - Default MODEL changed from deepseek_r1_distill_1p5b to gemma_4_e4b_it
    - Default EXPERIMENT_MODE changed from smoke to full
    - EXPERIMENT_ARGS now includes --quantization 4bit, --batch-size 1, --attn sdpa
    - GPU_FAILURE_MODE defaults to stop (fail-fast on GPU issues)
    - Set PYTORCH_CUDA_ALLOC_CONF=expandable_segments:True for tight VRAM
    - Notebook title and README updated to reflect Gemma target
    - resolve_low_vram_device_map in real_trace_experiments.py already offloads
      vision/audio towers to CPU for gemma_4_e4b_it

